{{!
    @template format_aicourse/chatbox

    The AI Tutor chat panel. Rendered once per page inside the hero banner and hidden until the
    AI Tutor button in the hero is pressed.

    It is an ARIA dialog: role="dialog" aria-modal="true" and aria-labelledby pointing at its own
    title. The message list is a role="log" aria-live="polite" region so replies, errors and the
    "Thinking…" state are announced, and it carries dir="auto" so a reply in a different script
    keeps its base direction. Opening, closing, the Tab focus trap, Escape and focus restoration
    are provided by format_aicourse/chatbox. Every SVG in here is decorative and therefore carries
    aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"; the icon-only close and send buttons have aria-labels.

    Classes required for JS:
    * aicourse-ai-chatbox - the panel root; shown/hidden by format_aicourse/chatbox.
    * aicourse-ai-chatbox-close - closes the panel.
    * aicourse-ai-quick-btn - fills the textarea with a canned prompt and sends it.
    * aicourse-ai-send-btn - sends the current textarea contents.
    * aicourse-ai-message, aicourse-ai-message-bot, aicourse-ai-message-content - matched by
      format_aicourse/chatbox when it updates the welcome message.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-prompt - on each quick action button, the key of the canned prompt to send. One of
      structure, concepts, workplace, practice, checklist.

    Element ids required for JS:
    * aicourse-ai-chatbox, aicourse-ai-close, aicourse-ai-messages, aicourse-ai-welcome,
      aicourse-ai-quick-actions, aicourse-ai-input, aicourse-ai-send.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * closelabel string Accessible name of the close button.
    * inputlabel string Visually hidden label of the question textarea.
    * placeholder string Placeholder of the question textarea.
    * sendlabel string Accessible name and tooltip of the send button.
    * welcome string PRE-ESCAPED greeting. It is the aiassistant_welcome_name /
      aiassistant_welcome_section / aiassistant_welcome_activity language string, which
      legitimately contains <strong>, resolved with $a values that have already been through
      format_string(). It is therefore rendered with a triple mustache.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "closelabel": "Close",
        "inputlabel": "Your question for the AI Tutor",
        "placeholder": "Ask a question about the course...",
        "sendlabel": "Send message",
        "welcome": "Hi Sam! I see you're working on <strong>Week 1 quiz</strong>. What would you like help with?"
    }
}}
<div id="aicourse-ai-chatbox" class="aicourse-ai-chatbox" style="display:none;" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="aicourse-ai-chatbox-title">
<div class="aicourse-ai-chatbox-header">
<div class="aicourse-ai-chatbox-title" id="aicourse-ai-chatbox-title"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 8V4H8"/><rect width="16" height="12" x="4" y="8" rx="2"/><path d="m9 15 2 2 4-4"/></svg><span>{{#str}} aiassistant, format_aicourse {{/str}}</span></div>
<button type="button" class="aicourse-ai-chatbox-close" id="aicourse-ai-close" aria-label="{{closelabel}}"><span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span></button>
</div>
<div class="aicourse-ai-chatbox-messages" id="aicourse-ai-messages" role="log" aria-live="polite" aria-relevant="additions" dir="auto">
<div class="aicourse-ai-message aicourse-ai-message-bot" id="aicourse-ai-welcome">
<div class="aicourse-ai-message-content">{{{welcome}}}</div>
</div>
<div class="aicourse-ai-quick-actions" id="aicourse-ai-quick-actions">
<div class="aicourse-ai-quick-label">{{#str}} aiassistant_quick_label, format_aicourse {{/str}}</div>
<div class="aicourse-ai-quick-buttons">
<button type="button" class="aicourse-ai-quick-btn" data-prompt="structure"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 3v18M3 12h18"/></svg>{{#str}} aiassistant_quick_structure, format_aicourse {{/str}}</button>
<button type="button" class="aicourse-ai-quick-btn" data-prompt="concepts"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg>{{#str}} aiassistant_quick_concepts, format_aicourse {{/str}}</button>
<button type="button" class="aicourse-ai-quick-btn" data-prompt="workplace"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 7h-9M14 17H5"/><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="3"/><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="3"/></svg>{{#str}} aiassistant_quick_workplace, format_aicourse {{/str}}</button>
<button type="button" class="aicourse-ai-quick-btn" data-prompt="practice"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M9 11l3 3L22 4"/><path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h11"/></svg>{{#str}} aiassistant_quick_practice, format_aicourse {{/str}}</button>
<button type="button" class="aicourse-ai-quick-btn" data-prompt="checklist"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2"/><rect x="9" y="3" width="6" height="4" rx="1"/><path d="m9 14 2 2 4-4"/></svg>{{#str}} aiassistant_quick_checklist, format_aicourse {{/str}}</button>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="aicourse-ai-chatbox-input">
<label class="accesshide" for="aicourse-ai-input">{{inputlabel}}</label>
<textarea id="aicourse-ai-input" dir="auto" rows="1" placeholder="{{placeholder}}"></textarea>
<button type="button" id="aicourse-ai-send" class="aicourse-ai-send-btn" aria-label="{{sendlabel}}" title="{{sendlabel}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="22" y1="2" x2="11" y2="13"></line><polygon points="22 2 15 22 11 13 2 9 22 2"></polygon></svg></button>
</div>
</div>
